00:21:21.860 --> 00:21:25.050
Apa ini pita pajangan ?

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:26.350
Kenapa ?

00:21:26.350 --> 00:21:28.930
Tapi itu sangat lucu !

00:22:59.310 --> 00:23:02.170
